{"ID":"20260705155508-x4p1kwu","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20260705155508-x4p1kwu","title":"windbg常用命令","type":"doc","updated":"20260705161901"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260705155510-vxnck32","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260705155510-vxnck32","updated":"20260705151908"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20260705151908-36hmj3s.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260705155510-sjr10za","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260705155510-sjr10za","updated":"20260705152028"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这是当前调试上下文的CPU寄存器状态"}]},{"ID":"20260705155510-66tnxt8","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260705155510-66tnxt8","updated":"20260705150326"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":".lastevent"}]},{"ID":"20260705155510-kb9axu1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260705155510-kb9axu1","updated":"20260705153408"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"看最近一次异常/事件概况\n快速判断“最后停下来的原因是不是异常”\n快速拿到异常线程和异常码"}]},{"ID":"20260705155510-wzznsgy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260705155510-wzznsgy","updated":"20260705155130"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20260705152030-da2toa1.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260705155510-yon934s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260705155510-yon934s","updated":"20260705153326"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"看 4 个点："}]},{"ID":"20260705155510-mzgqncm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260705155510-mzgqncm","updated":"20260705153418"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"4b58.4528"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n4b58 是进程 ID\n4528 是线程 ID\n说明最后异常发生在线程 4528"}]},{"ID":"20260705155510-0ukt7im","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260705155510-0ukt7im","updated":"20260705153428"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"code c0000006"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n主异常码\n0xc0000006 "},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"="}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" EXCEPTION"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"IN"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"PAGE"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"ERROR\n含义：程序访问某块内存时，系统要把页面从磁盘/映射文件读进来，但失败了"}]},{"ID":"20260705155510-42ozoy5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260705155510-42ozoy5","updated":"20260705153432"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"In-page I/O error c000009c"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n更底层的 I/O 状态\n0xc000009c 通常偏向设备读错误/介质错误"}]},{"ID":"20260705155510-zuncokb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260705155510-zuncokb","updated":"20260705153436"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"first/second chance not available"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n不是说没异常\n是这个 mini dump 没保留完整 chance 信息"}]},{"ID":"20260705155510-wyu3o07","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260705155510-wyu3o07","updated":"20260705151201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":".exr -1"}]},{"ID":"20260705155510-pyq4thw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260705155510-pyq4thw","updated":"20260705153826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拿最近一次异常记录\n读正式异常记录\n给你“异常地址 + 异常码 + 参数”"}]},{"ID":"20260705155510-xpf7tl1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260705155510-xpf7tl1","updated":"20260705152841"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20260705152841-v3xn6fr.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260705155510-gxjtced","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260705155510-gxjtced","updated":"20260705153501"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"看 5 个点："}]},{"ID":"20260705155510-a915l6v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260705155510-a915l6v","updated":"20260705153513"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"ExceptionAddress"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n异常地址\n这里是 5fe17dc9\n落在 Windows"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Globalization.dll"}]},{"ID":"20260705155510-271em9g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260705155510-271em9g","updated":"20260705153634"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"ExceptionCode"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n和 .lastevent 一致，还是 c0000006"}]},{"ID":"20260705155510-21e19ho","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260705155510-21e19ho","updated":"20260705153644"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Parameter[0]     故障类型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n对 c0000006 来说是异常类型细节\n一般不如后两个直观"}]},{"ID":"20260705155510-mgk2qr3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260705155510-mgk2qr3","updated":"20260705153635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Parameter[1]     出错的内存地址"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n出问题的地址/相关地址\n这里也是 5fe17dc9"}]},{"ID":"20260705155510-caf3u47","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260705155510-caf3u47","updated":"20260705153807"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Parameter[2]     底层 IO 错误码"}]},{"ID":"20260705155510-rzpe82d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260705155510-rzpe82d","updated":"20260705153656"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"最关键\n这里是 c000009c\n就是底层 I/O 错误状态"}]},{"ID":"20260705155510-r1s3rqv","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260705155510-r1s3rqv","updated":"20260705151207"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":".ecxr"}]},{"ID":"20260705155510-0jygl1q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260705155510-0jygl1q","updated":"20260705154212"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"切到异常上下文\n把当前调试上下文切到“异常发生那一刻”\n之后再执行 kb，拿到的才是异常现场栈"}]},{"ID":"20260705155510-6h5gaj4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260705155510-6h5gaj4","updated":"20260705152930"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20260705152930-7wp12xs.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260705155510-l1s1x7g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260705155510-l1s1x7g","updated":"20260705154129"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"看 3 个点："}]},{"ID":"20260705155510-jj0l22z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260705155510-jj0l22z","updated":"20260705154142"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"eip=5fe17dc9"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\nx86 下 eip 就是当前指令地址\n它和 .exr -1 的 ExceptionAddress: 5fe17dc9 对上了\n这说明你已经切到了异常现场"}]},{"ID":"20260705155510-0fmuuhh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260705155510-0fmuuhh","updated":"20260705154146"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"模块名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n还是 Windows"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Globalization\n和异常记录一致"}]},{"ID":"20260705155510-3sk4uii","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260705155510-3sk4uii","updated":"20260705154152"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"当前汇编"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\nmov edi,edi 本身没特殊意义\n重点不是这条指令做了什么\n重点是“当前上下文已经定位到异常地址”"}]},{"ID":"20260705155510-nxl700g","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260705155510-nxl700g","updated":"20260705151215"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"kb"}]},{"ID":"20260705155510-1avbb1r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260705155510-1avbb1r","updated":"20260705154356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"打印崩溃线程调用栈\n看异常是沿着什么调用链触发的\n判断故障模块、业务场景、是否像 crash 现场"}]},{"ID":"20260705155510-e20q5y3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260705155510-e20q5y3","updated":"20260705153010"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20260705152944-h6jo3rp.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260705155510-hjkacmb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260705155510-hjkacmb","updated":"20260705154320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"怎么看："}]},{"ID":"20260705155510-st1y0a2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260705155510-st1y0a2","updated":"20260705154331"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"栈顶最重要"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n00 到 08 在 Windows"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Globalization\n说明异常发生在这个模块内部"}]},{"ID":"20260705155510-zjayf7i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260705155510-zjayf7i","updated":"20260705154335"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"再往下看业务场景"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\nmsftedit!CTxtBreaker / AutoCorrect / OnTxChar\n这是明显的文本输入、分词、自动纠错链路"}]},{"ID":"20260705155510-1hrdyuq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260705155510-1hrdyuq","updated":"20260705154338"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"再往下看宿主 UI"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\nDuiLib\nWXWork"}]},{"ID":"20260705155510-sh4mbvt","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260705155510-sh4mbvt","updated":"20260705160245"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"!teb"}]},{"ID":"20260705155510-dlf6p2i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260705155510-dlf6p2i","updated":"20260705154439"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"看当前线程的TEB（线程环境块）信息"}]},{"ID":"20260705155510-qraripd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260705155510-qraripd","updated":"20260705153110"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20260705153110-a25e96e.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260705155510-wk9ke9q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260705155510-wk9ke9q","updated":"20260705154448"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"看 3 个点："}]},{"ID":"20260705155510-wmidg4b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260705155510-wmidg4b","updated":"20260705154458"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"ClientId"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n4b58 . 4528\n跟 .lastevent 里的 4b58.4528 对上了\n说明你看的 TEB 就是异常线程"}]},{"ID":"20260705155510-r5oye3h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260705155510-r5oye3h","updated":"20260705154502"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"LastErrorValue: 0"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\nWin32 错误码为 0\n没太大帮助"}]},{"ID":"20260705155510-fpvamub","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260705155510-fpvamub","updated":"20260705154509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"LastStatusValue: c000000f"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n线程最近一次 NTSTATUS\n是辅助线索，不是主证据\n不要拿它覆盖 .exr -1 里的 c000009c"}]},{"ID":"20260705155510-6uosh4l","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260705155510-6uosh4l","updated":"20260705155510"}},{"ID":"20260705155510-1or5vgg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260705155510-1or5vgg","updated":"20260705155019"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一般就按 .lastevent -\u003e .exr -1 -\u003e .ecxr -\u003e kb -\u003e !teb 这顺序看：\n先用 .lastevent 看最后一次是不是明确的异常事件，比如 c0000006/c0000005 这种；\n再用 .exr -1 确认确实有完整异常记录，能看到异常地址、异常码和参数；\n接着 .ecxr 切到异常当时的上下文，如果寄存器里的 eip/rip 能对上异常地址，说明现场是有效的；\n然后 kb 看异常线程的调用栈，能看到清晰的栈顶模块和调用链，基本就能确认这是崩溃现场；\n最后 !teb 主要是补线程信息和 LastErrorValue/LastStatusValue 做辅助校验。"}]},{"ID":"20260705155510-82deh6g","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260705155510-82deh6g","updated":"20260705155510"}},{"ID":"20260705155809-co1ydnb","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260705155809-co1ydnb","updated":"20260705161901"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"!analyze -v"}]},{"ID":"20260705160351-vildwho","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260705160351-vildwho","updated":"20260705161631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"!analyze"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 是 WinDbg/CDB 内置自动分析扩展命令，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"-v"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ "},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"="}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" verbose 详细模式。作用："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"自动全盘解析当前 Dump，输出系统预分类结论、崩溃完整细节、内置标签线索"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，是你整套归因流程里核心数据源之一。"}]},{"ID":"20260705161900-byv3ozj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260705161900-byv3ozj","updated":"20260705161901"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"!analyze -v 自动完整分析 Dump，输出系统官方故障分类 BucketID、内存操作类型、进程全部加载模块，是你判断硬件故障、输入法 / 第三方注入场景、标记 funcPtrMode 的核心依据。"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Checksum 警告"}]},{"ID":"20260705161635-booljbf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260705161635-booljbf","updated":"20260705161649"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"WARNING: Unable to verify checksum for ntdll.dll\nChecksum mismatch\n含义：DLL 在内存里的校验和和文件原始校验和对不上；\n常见原因：第三方输入法、安全软件 Hook 篡改系统模块内存；\n项目用途：仅做辅助备注，不参与核心判定，大量出现可侧面佐证注入场景。"}]},{"ID":"20260705161622-8jvgc8t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260705161622-8jvgc8t","updated":"20260705161625"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Exception Analysis 核心区块"}]},{"ID":"20260705161656-fz16k51","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260705161656-fz16k51","updated":"20260705161728"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这一段是自动分析的结论主体，你的绝大多数规则都靠这里提取文本：\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"崩溃基础信息："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"ExceptionCode、崩溃地址、操作类型（读 / 写 / 执行内存）\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"提取 AV.Type:"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Execute，是 funcPtrMode 三大判断条件之一；\nFAILURE_BUCKET_ID 故障桶 ID（优先级最高硬件故障判定依赖它）\n桶内带hardware_disk、无application_fault → 提前判定 hardware_issue、confidence=high；\n同时包含application_fault+hardware_ 混合标签，排除硬件分类；\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Faulting module："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"触发崩溃的模块，用来判断 exceptionModule 是否为空；\n内置场景标签：text_input、heap_corruption、hook 等文本线索，用于场景关联检测。"}]},{"ID":"20260705161824-1rq30qc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260705161824-1rq30qc","updated":"20260705161828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":". Faulting Thread 崩溃线程精简栈"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n简化版调用栈，和你 kb 完整栈互相校验，快速看到栈顶函数（比如 WordBreak、Imm 输入法相关函数），匹配文本输入场景关键词。"}]},{"ID":"20260705161807-5g4ii1p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260705161807-5g4ii1p","updated":"20260705161814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Loaded Modules 全进程加载 DLL 清单"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n输出 Dump 里所有加载的第三方、系统、企微自身模块；\n场景检测规则用它校验：栈命中文本关键词 + 进程存在输入法 DLL → 判定 third_party_hit。"}]},{"ID":"20260705161831-b3vt843","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260705161831-b3vt843","updated":"20260705161831"}}]}